# A probe that must live INSIDE a package for module resolution (`bun test` resolves `solid-js`
# only from within the package that depends on it) is one broad `git add` away from shipping into
# a release surface. Measured twice: `ea62baa5d` swept three, and a fourth
# (`packages/app/packages/app/tmp-probe/`) reached HEAD and red the `script` unit's own ledger,
# which asserts that every test file in the tree belongs to a run unit.
